168	  severity: 'blocking',
169	  description: 'An L.tileLayer(...) built with a literal options object carries the tile provider\'s attribution',
170	  doc: 'packs/leaflet/RULES.md',
171	  why: 'the provider\'s attribution is a licence term, not decoration — an unattributed tile layer uses the tiles outside their terms, and nothing about the running map looks wrong, so a UI tidy-up drops it and no one notices',
